+@ Fallen Ashe chapter one. The player sees Mom chased by a Dane, chooses an
+@ original starter from her dropped Poké Balls, and confronts Rook.
+@ The new Rook object is a temporary Maxie-based sprite until original art ships.
 Route101_EventScript_BirchsBag::
     lockall
     faceplayer
+    playse SE_BALL_BOUNCE_1
     msgbox FallenAshe_Text_MomDropsBalls, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
-    setflag FLAG_SYS_POKEMON_GET
-    setflag FLAG_RESCUED_BIRCH
+    @ This is Emerald's native three-Poké-Ball selector. The starter species
+    @ currently occupy the Treecko, Mudkip and Torchic source species slots.
     fadescreen FADE_TO_BLACK
     removeobject LOCALID_ROUTE101_ZIGZAGOON
     setobjectxy LOCALID_PLAYER, 6, 13
     applymovement LOCALID_PLAYER, Common_Movement_WalkInPlaceFasterLeft
     waitmovement 0
     special ChooseStarter
-    @ The source-based starter callback resumes this event without a wild battle.
+    @ Returns to this script after confirming Verdrake, Aqualye or Embergryph.
